Invoke the `bmad-review-adversarial-general` skill on the diff below. This is a diff for a "Produkt bewerten" (rate a product 1-5 with author name, upsert on repeat rating) feature in an ASP.NET Core 10 / EF Core 10 backend and Angular 22 frontend e-commerce app. The upsert logic uses `ExecuteUpdateAsync` first, falling back to `Add`+`SaveChangesAsync` with a `DbUpdateException` catch for races on the composite primary key `(ProductId, AuthorName)`.

Follow the bmad-review-adversarial-general skill's own process exactly. Report findings as that skill specifies.

